      "cooked": "<p>Well, actually my first game (Omnitron in Time Cataclysm) was fairly straight-forward, it's the second one I want to ask about (Akash'Bhuta in the Final Wasteland; it's nightmarish). Firstly, Primeval Eruption was played when there was only one card in the hero deck; should you shuffle it before revealing cards? And secondly, if a card deals damage to multiple targets ('all targets except itself', in this case), can you use Twist The Ether to raise the damage dealt to villains while lowering the amount dealt to heroes?</p>",
